## VCO-Managed Files

This project's `.claude/hooks/`, `.claude/scripts/`, `.claude/agents/`, `.claude/skills/`, and `.claude/settings.json` are shipped by VCO (the orchestrator). To update them, run from the orchestrator root:

```bash
python -m vco_lib.project_init install-bundle \
  --folder '{{PROJECT_ROOT}}' \
  --orchestrator-root "$VCT_ORCHESTRATOR_ROOT" \
  --update
```

Add `--force` to accept the shipped versions for files you've intentionally modified. Files preserved by VCO are tracked in `.claude/.vco-manifest.json` under `preserved_files`.

